        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Which operation and customer are actually unhealthy?\nCompare **SyncProject** across **All** customers. Select **project-red** to investigate, or **project-green** as a healthy control.\n\nContinuous traffic. Recurring incidents. Slow 200s hurt latency; fast 429s hurt availability. SLOs use **Success + Failure**, regardless of the Outcome filter. Objectives are illustrative.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "title": "Read the demo like a service owner",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "Availability: Success / (Success + Failure). ClientError and Ignored are excluded, regardless of the Outcome filter.",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(operation_duration_milliseconds_count{Operation=~\"$operation\",CustomerResourceId=~\"$customer\",LocationId=~\"$location\",Outcome=\"Success\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / (sum(rate(operation_duration_milliseconds_count{Operation=~\"$operation\",CustomerResourceId=~\"$customer\",LocationId=~\"$location\",Outcome=~\"Success|Failure\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "success rate",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Success rate (objective: >= 99%)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Exact latency SLI: fraction of Success or Failure operations completed in <= 250 ms. ClientError and Ignored are excluded. Uses the opt-in threshold counter, not histogram interpolation. The Outcome filter does not change the SLO population.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
